      "content": "u guys are always so cautious lol. i just searched online and a lot of people say it's just normal aging or just too much screen time. i'm feeling way too dizzy to drive to a clinic anyway. if i just take a high dose of some vitamin b or maybe some ibuprofen for the headache, would that help clear the vision stuff up? surely it's not something crazy if it just started like that.",
